# When Wills Collide (WotG 46), the whole run. With the Bottled Punch Bug the Veridical Conflux plays the event 29 [89,
# 6]; its finish with option 99 sets the char down at -700.042 0.4 -441.301 rot 192 in the Walk of Echoes (the next
# tick). The login there at Status 0 plays no zone-in event, nor does the warp that gives the flow its zone. The Ornate
# Door (_521) plays 1; the update with option 5 sends 05C [119, 0, 0, 8, 8, 21, 0, 1] (the face 0; nothing equipped:
# head 0, body and hands 8, main 21, sub 0, the bare models); the finish sets Status 1. At Status 1 the door sends only
# the release. A Bronze Cap, Harness, Mittens, Sword and Lauan Shield equipped; Status 2 (a GM, for the fight no
# battlefield file holds): the rezone plays the zone-in 2; the update with option 5 sends 05C [182, 0, 15, 15, 15, 268,
# 37]; the finish completes the mission (Whispers of Dawn current).
uncovered: 1/-/onEventFinish:32001 -- no battlefield file holds When Wills Collide's fight (no scripts/battlefields/Walk_of_Echoes folder, no C# battlefield in WalkOfEchoes, no xi.battlefield.id constant), so nothing opens 32001 in the Walk of Echoes; the finish (Status 2 and the set-down) is pinned by the fake check c3 T8 wotg 46 in tests/XI.Verify.Quests/C3ToauT8.cs
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrade GraubergS/onEventFinish/29 GraubergS/onEventFinish/42 WalkOfEchoes/_521/onTrigger WalkOfEchoes/onZoneIn/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/2 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/2
char zone=GraubergS pos=-140.28,-6.749,585.24 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg WhenWillsCollide current
keyitem BottledPunchBug
item BronzeCap
item BronzeHarness
item BronzeMittens
item BronzeSword
item LauanShield
login
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # the key item: 29
finish option=99                           # set down in the Walk of Echoes
tick 400
login                                      # Status 0: no zone-in event
warp -700.042,0.4,-441.301 WalkOfEchoes    # the parse zone (the harness reads no setPos)
trigger _521                               # 1
update 1 option=5                          # the face and the models (nothing equipped)
finish                                     # Status 1
trigger _521                               # Status 1: nothing
equip BronzeCap Head
equip BronzeHarness Body
equip BronzeMittens Hands
equip BronzeSword Main
equip LauanShield Sub
charvar Mission[5][45]Status 2             # a GM: the fight no battlefield file holds
rezone open                                # 2
update 2 option=5                          # the face and the models
finish                                     # completed
